OL,3,ABystander who tackled suspect after
OL,4,AAustralian MP attacked with car said he
OL,5,Ahad 'no choice'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAustralian MP Helen Haines is in a
OL,8,Fcritical condition and has reportedly
OL,9,Flost her leg after being hit by a car
OL,10,Foutside her electoral office in
OL,11,FVictoria
OL,13,FThe suspect allegedly did a U-turn in
OL,14,Forder to strike the MP and then
OL,15,Freversed to ram her a second time, Home
OL,16,FAffairs Minister Tony Burke says
OL,18,FA 43-year-old man, from nearby
OL,19,FTarrawingee, was detained at the scene
OL,20,Fby a local barber before being taken
OL,21,Finto custody
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
